22 concepts, 15 already mapped across 3 MoCs. Surveying the 7 unmapped ones by theme surfaced **one ripe, coherent cluster**:

**`mocs/autonomous-search-loop.md`** — *The Autonomous Experiment-Search Loop* (5 concepts)
